{
  "dom_id": "step-615696",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Applying a Percentage Increase: Word Problems",
  "problem": "A t-shirt costs $\\[math]18$ before tax. If a $9\\%$ sales tax is applied, what is the total cost after tax?",
  "worked_solution": "To find the total cost after tax, we apply a $9\\%$ increase to the original price.\n\nIncreasing by $9\\%$ means that we must apply a new percentage of\n\n$$\n100\\% + 9\\% = 109\\% = 1.09\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply the original price by $1.09{:}$\n\n$$\n18 \\times 1.09 = 19.62.\n$$\n\nSo, the total cost after tax is $\\[math]19.62.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-615696\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"615696\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"21451\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-615696\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-5\">Applying a Percentage Increase: Word Problems</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"615696\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                 